<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<odoo noupdate="1">
    <record id="activity_plan_project_kickoff" model="mail.activity.plan" forcecreate="0">
        <field name="name">Architecture project kickoff</field>
        <field name="res_model">project.project</field>
    </record>
    <record id="activity_plan_project_kickoff_1" model="mail.activity.plan.template" forcecreate="0">
        <field name="plan_id" ref="activity_plan_project_kickoff"/>
        <field name="sequence">1</field>
        <field name="activity_type_id" ref="mail.mail_activity_data_todo"/>
        <field name="summary">Confirm the client brief and project site</field>
        <field name="delay_count">0</field>
        <field name="delay_unit">days</field>
        <field name="delay_from">after_plan_date</field>
        <field name="responsible_type">on_demand</field>
        <field name="note" type="html"><p>Review Client Brief, select the actual site contact for the map, confirm the scope, exclusions and requested start date, and name the client review contact.</p></field>
    </record>
    <record id="activity_plan_project_kickoff_2" model="mail.activity.plan.template" forcecreate="0">
        <field name="plan_id" ref="activity_plan_project_kickoff"/>
        <field name="sequence">2</field>
        <field name="activity_type_id" ref="mail.mail_activity_data_todo"/>
        <field name="summary">Agree the team, programme and fee milestones</field>
        <field name="delay_count">1</field>
        <field name="delay_unit">days</field>
        <field name="delay_from">after_plan_date</field>
        <field name="responsible_type">on_demand</field>
        <field name="note" type="html"><p>Map the project lead and designer roles to staff. Set the actual project dates, task dependencies, budget hours and review dates. Check each milestone against its sales order line and agreed fee condition.</p></field>
    </record>
    <record id="activity_plan_project_kickoff_3" model="mail.activity.plan.template" forcecreate="0">
        <field name="plan_id" ref="activity_plan_project_kickoff"/>
        <field name="sequence">3</field>
        <field name="activity_type_id" ref="mail.mail_activity_data_todo"/>
        <field name="summary">Set document access and client release rules</field>
        <field name="delay_count">1</field>
        <field name="delay_unit">days</field>
        <field name="delay_from">after_plan_date</field>
        <field name="responsible_type">on_demand</field>
        <field name="note" type="html"><p>Keep working documents internal. Review folder membership and share only agreed files from Client Deliverables with the named client contacts.</p></field>
    </record>
    <record id="activity_plan_phase_review" model="mail.activity.plan" forcecreate="0">
        <field name="name">Architecture phase review</field>
        <field name="res_model">project.task</field>
    </record>
    <record id="activity_plan_phase_review_1" model="mail.activity.plan.template" forcecreate="0">
        <field name="plan_id" ref="activity_plan_phase_review"/>
        <field name="sequence">1</field>
        <field name="activity_type_id" ref="mail.mail_activity_data_todo"/>
        <field name="summary">Prepare the phase review package</field>
        <field name="delay_count">0</field>
        <field name="delay_unit">days</field>
        <field name="delay_from">after_plan_date</field>
        <field name="responsible_type">on_demand</field>
        <field name="note" type="html"><p>Complete the deliverables and internal review. Identify drawing revisions, unresolved items and the decision needed from the client review contact.</p></field>
    </record>
    <record id="activity_plan_phase_review_2" model="mail.activity.plan.template" forcecreate="0">
        <field name="plan_id" ref="activity_plan_phase_review"/>
        <field name="sequence">2</field>
        <field name="activity_type_id" ref="mail.mail_activity_data_todo"/>
        <field name="summary">Record the client decision</field>
        <field name="delay_count">3</field>
        <field name="delay_unit">days</field>
        <field name="delay_from">after_plan_date</field>
        <field name="responsible_type">on_demand</field>
        <field name="note" type="html"><p>Collect written acceptance or requested changes on the review task. A contact assignment or a Kanban stage is not approval. Agree a new review date if needed.</p></field>
    </record>
    <record id="activity_plan_phase_review_3" model="mail.activity.plan.template" forcecreate="0">
        <field name="plan_id" ref="activity_plan_phase_review"/>
        <field name="sequence">3</field>
        <field name="activity_type_id" ref="mail.mail_activity_data_todo"/>
        <field name="summary">Review the milestone and invoiceable work</field>
        <field name="delay_count">5</field>
        <field name="delay_unit">days</field>
        <field name="delay_from">after_plan_date</field>
        <field name="responsible_type">on_demand</field>
        <field name="note" type="html"><p>Once the agreed condition is met, mark the linked milestone as reached. Review native Sales invoiceable quantities, hourly extras and agreed expenses, then prepare the invoice.</p></field>
    </record>
</odoo>
